+/* ---- A3.2 doorbell seam test: read one uint64 from HOST memory via a flexio_window ----
+ * Proves the DPA can read a host-memory doorbell (the RoCE responder will bump it per WRITE_IMM). `arg` is the
+ * DPA-heap host2dev struct; tt_win_id/tt_db_mkey/tt_db_haddr describe the host doorbell. Returns the value
